 "name_en": "Digital Payments (1S2)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Digital Payments (1S2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP digital payments is a payment hub between payment service providers and SAP components, solutions, or applications that process incoming credit card payments.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item enables the integration between <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> and SAP digital payments, which allows you to use credit card payment methods in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> for incoming payments.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The complete process from settlement using secure tokens via payment service provider advice to final bank statement is covered and automated.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Various payment service providers are supported.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Send payment document from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> Sales or SAP Customer Payments solution to SAP digital payments scheduled settlement program</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Request and receive the payment advice from SAP digital payments on a scheduled basis</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process incoming bank statements with normal cash management process</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Handle credit card payment method for incoming payments easily</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Handle secured credit card information via token</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the process of digital payments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>数字付款 (1S2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP 数字付款是付款服务提供商与 SAP 组件、解决方案或应用程序之间的付款中心，用于处理信用卡收款。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 和 SAP 数字付款之间的集成，允许您使用 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的信用卡付款方式进行收款。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">涵盖从使用安全令牌通过付款服务提供商通知结算到最终银行对账单的完整流程，并实现自动化。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">支持各种付款服务提供商。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将付款凭证从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> Sales 或 SAP Customer Payments 解决方案发送到 SAP 数字付款计划结算程序</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">按计划从 SAP 数字付款请求和接收付款通知</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用常规现金管理流程处理收款银行对账单</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod42b07b1859048cdaea331810ed92e9f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松处理收款的信用卡付款方式</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过令牌处理安全信用卡信息</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化数字付款流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
